  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿，之前找巨大的掘掘兔的时候\n多谢你帮忙啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF0C4E4B524D627E5DE859277684639863985154768465F65019000A591A8C224F605E2E5FD95566300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我当时只能在一旁看着\n你和那家伙战斗，但……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F5365F653EA80FD57284E0065C1770B7740000A4F60548C90A35BB64F1962186597FF0C4F462026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个时候我感觉到内心深处\n有一朵小小的火花被点燃了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A65F650196211611F89C9523051855FC36DF15904000A67094E0067355C0F5C0F7684706B82B188AB70B971C34E86300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想变得像你一样强！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F353D85F9750CF4F604E0068375F3AFF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那之后我可拼命啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不管是作为训练家还是旅行者，\n都可以说是从零重新出发。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E4B540E621153EF62FC547D5566300200100001BE01000A4E0D7BA1662F4F5C4E3A8BAD7EC35BB68FD8662F65C5884C8005FF0C000A90FD53EF4EE58BF4662F4ECE96F691CD65B051FA53D1300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！\n现在就来和我对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF01000A73B057285C316765548C62115BF962185427FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要让你看看和我孕育了\n超～巨大牵绊的伙伴们！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818BA94F60770B770B548C62115B5580B24E86000A8D85FF5E5DE8592772757ECA76844F194F344EECFF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哎呀，\n我这是在激动得发抖呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等你做好一决胜负的准备，\n就尽管来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654CE5440FF0C000A62118FD9662F57286FC052A85F9753D162965462300200100001BE01000A7B494F60505A597D4E0051B380DC8D1F768451C65907FF0C000A5C315C3D7BA16765627E62115427300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说你已经做好\n一决胜负的准备了对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF44F605DF27ECF505A597D000A4E0051B380DC8D1F768451C659074E865BF95427FF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备就绪了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C659075C317EEA4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还没准备好",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86CA151C65907597D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK！\n那就让我们赶快开始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004BFF01000A90A35C318BA962114EEC8D765FEB5F0059CB5427300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇兔！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C75154FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要上咯……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0A54AF2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超～～～巨大<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85FF5EFF5EFF5E5DE8592700100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牵绊的<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72757ECA768400100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伙伴们！！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F194F344EECFF01FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘掘兔，得让对方看看我们\n最～最～巨大的牵绊啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639863985154FF0C5F978BA95BF965B9770B770B62114EEC000A6700FF5E6700FF5E5DE85927768472757ECA554AFF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么样！\n我可是捉了好多头目来培育呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E486837FF01000A621153EF662F63494E86597D591A593476EE676557F980B25462300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总感觉头目这种宝可梦\n充满了野生的力量……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B611F89C9593476EE8FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6000A51456EE14E8691CE751F7684529B91CF2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没准在很久很久以前，\n到处都是头目呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA151C657285F884E455F884E454EE5524DFF0C000A5230590490FD662F593476EE5462FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我是想着必须要去看看广阔的世界，\n所以才离开了生我养我的密阿雷。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366211662F60F377405FC5987B898153BB770B770B5E7F961476844E16754CFF0C000A62404EE5624D79BB5F004E86751F6211517B621176845BC6963F96F7300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但当我如今重新在这个城市停留，\n享受着新的发现和邂逅……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465F53621159824ECA91CD65B057288FD94E2A57CE5E02505C7559FF0C000A4EAB53D7774065B0768453D173B0548C908290052026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……然后呀，\n我就突然意识到了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620267136540E5440FF0C000A62115C317A817136610F8BC652304E86300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管是在异国他乡还是在熟悉的街头，\n只要自己觉得是在旅行，那就是旅行！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n重要的是自己可以从中得到什么。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1662F57285F0256FD4ED64E618FD8662F5728719F6089768488575934FF0C000A53EA898181EA5DF189C95F97662F572865C5884CFF0C90A35C31662F65C5884CFF0100100001BE01000A91CD89817684662F81EA5DF153EF4EE54ECE4E2D5F9752304EC04E48300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要在密阿雷再待上一段时间，\n按照自己的方式享受旅行。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898157285BC6963F96F7518D5F854E0A4E006BB565F695F4FF0C000A6309716781EA5DF1768465B95F0F4EAB53D765C5884C300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇，掘哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C7FF0C639854C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多谢你和我对战啦。\n总有一天我一定会赶上你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A8C224F60548C62115BF9621855663002000A603B67094E00592962114E005B9A4F1A8D764E0A4F607684300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    }
